# Quick Reference: Prediction vs. Compare

| | 🔮 Prediction (Forecast) | 📊 Live vs Predicted (Compare) |
|:---|:---|:---|
| **Goal** | Forecast unknown future values | Test how accurate a model is in real-time |
| **Training Data** | All collected data | Only the first portion (e.g., 50%) |
| **What Gets Predicted** | Next 60 seconds beyond the data | The remaining portion of the collection |
| **Confidence Band** | ✅ Yes (shaded 95% CI) | ❌ No (direct two-line comparison) |
| **Phase Badges** | None | "Training Phase" → "Comparing Live vs Predicted" |
| **Training Split Slider** | Hidden | Visible (adjustable 30%-70%) |
| **Main Teaching Point** | Forecasting & trend projection | Model validation & train/test splitting |
| **Best First Exercise** | Use AUTO to forecast temperature | Use ARIMA vs. LSTM on the same sensor |

